.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-edit 1  "edit " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-edit \- Change a task\*(Aqs title or description
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit edit\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change a task\*(Aqs title or description
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIR\fR>

.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit edit 1 \-\-title "buy oat milk"
  orbit edit 3f2b9c \-\-description "two litres"
  orbit edit 1 \-\-title "buy oat milk" \-\-dry\-run
